{
  "bookId": "hero-214005",
  "id": "bond-27528",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "27528001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "明智光秀",
          "text": "那封信，主公拆开看过了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27528002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "当然没有，你不是说今日拆开吗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27528003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "明智光秀",
          "text": "嗯，请。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27528004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……故意用来捉弄我的信，现在拆开有什么作用？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27528005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "只要我做出没看过的样子……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27528006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "嗯？？这个是？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27528007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "装满钱的信封",
          "text": "今日闲暇，可否请主公竹亭一游？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27528008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这，这怎么可能，我之前打开的时候……额，我的意思是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27528009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "明智光秀",
          "text": "主公无需再解释了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27528010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "明智光秀",
          "text": "这封信上有一行特殊的墨水，只有和光线接触过，才会渐渐浮现出来，覆盖原来的文字，反应的时间会很缓慢，大抵三天左右。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27528011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "明智光秀",
          "text": "算算时间，现在正好。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27528012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……你算计我？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27528013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "明智光秀",
          "text": "并非算计，只是为了勾起主公好奇。到了这时候，主公便会愿意主动空出时间。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27528014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "你正常邀请，我不也能空出时间吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27528015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "明智光秀",
          "text": "正常的邀请，又怎能看见主公如此有趣的神情？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
